OL,3,GNEWSAHuge delays after lorry crashes
OL,4,Athrough M60 central barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have faced long delays after a
OL,7,Florry crashed through the central
OL,8,Fbarrier of the M60, forcing part of the
OL,9,Fmotorway to close in both directions.
OL,11,FThe crash happened just before 07:30
OL,12,FGMT at junction 15, where the M60 meets
OL,13,Fthe M61 near Swinton in Greater
OL,14,FManchester, National Highways said. It
OL,15,Fhad followed an earlier crash in the
OL,16,Fsame area.
OL,18,FGreater Manchester Police said the
OL,19,Fheavy goods vehicle hit the central
OL,20,Freservation safety barriers and leaked
OL,21,Ffuel. No-one was injured.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
