OL,3,GNEWSAHuge delays after lorry crashes
OL,4,Athrough M60 central barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clockwise carriageway has been shut
OL,7,Fbetween junctions 13 and 15, causing
OL,8,Fdelays of about an hour. The
OL,9,Fanticlockwise carriageway, which was
OL,10,Fshut between junctions 15 and 14, has
OL,11,Fsince partially reopened.
